            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Louis XIV's Early Life</strong><br>\nLouis XIV was born on September 5, 1638, in the French royal family. His reign began when he was just four years old, after his father, Louis XIII, passed away. During his early years, France was governed by his mother, Anne of Austria, as regent, and her minister, Cardinal Mazarin. Louis XIV experienced the turmoil of the French nobility's rebellion known as the Fronde during his childhood, which influenced his later political views and his desire for absolute monarchical control.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Ascension to Power</strong><br>\nLouis XIV took control of the government in 1661 following Mazarin's death. Rejecting the appointment of a prime minister, he decided to rule France directly and stated, \"I am the state.\" His personal rule as an absolute monarch started at that point and continued for over 72 years, the longest recorded reign of any European monarch in history. During this period, he worked to centralize and strengthen the authority of the monarchy.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Patron of the Arts</strong><br>\nHe is well known for his patronage of the arts, believing that culture could enhance his royal glory. Louis XIV supported French literature, arts, and sciences, leading to the flourishing of French culture during his reign. He established various institutions like the Academy of Sciences and the Royal Academy of Painting and Sculpture. The magnificence of his court and the cultural life he fostered reflected the grandeur he sought for France.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
